# Local only (19 Oct 2026). The repository carries the code, the research record and the current best model; everything
# below stays on the research machine. A few files inside these folders are tracked on purpose (added with
# `git add -f`): the best chat model and its core in runs/ (Git LFS), the permanent fact store in data_real/ (Git LFS),
# and the small held-out test files the suite reads (data_chat22/eval_clean, data_core/eval_clean, data_mt/heldout).
# Tracked files stay tracked; to share another file from these folders, add it with `git add -f`.
runs/
/data/
/data_*/
models/
archive/
*.pt
*.npy

